                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p dir=\"ltr\">This dataset is used by</p><p dir=\"ltr\">Swinkels (2023) “Trading carbon credits on the blockchain” SSRN Working Paper <a href=\"https://dx.doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.4378871\" target=\"_blank\">https://dx.doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.4378871</a></p><p dir=\"ltr\">The data was obtained from the public blockchain of AirCarbon Exchange <a href=\"https://trade.aircarbon.co/explore\" target=\"_blank\">https://trade.aircarbon.co/explore</a></p><p dir=\"ltr\">During 2023, this public blockchain was made inaccessible by ACX.</p>"
